Id: mail001w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_mail
References: postconf(5), exim(8), doveconf(1)
Controls: CIS 3.10; NIST SC-8; ISO 5.14, 8.24

Mail passwords cross in clear: SMTP AUTH or a plaintext
authenticator with nothing requiring TLS, or Dovecot with
plaintext allowed or TLS off. Whoever listens owns the
mailboxes. Require TLS for authentication.
